---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: invest(amount, signature)
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_period --> q_check_sig: block.timestamp in [prefundStartTime, prefundEndTime] OR [startTime, endTime]
    q_check_period --> q_revert_period: outside investment windows
    q_check_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid from authorized Legion signer
    q_check_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: below minimum
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: bidToken.transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> q_emit: totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Investment(investor, amount, timestamp)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_revert_period --> [*]: revert OutsideInvestmentPeriod
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment

    note right of q_update_position
        INV-001: investorPosition[investor].investedCapital increases monotonically during sale
        INV-002: totalInvestedCapital = sum of all investor positions
        INV-003: contract bidToken balance >= totalInvestedCapital
    end note
